#: ../../source/docs/can-bus-driver-roadmap.rst:7
#: d18c23e6563944d2b0455b2928245e36
msgid ""
"The base for hardware CAN bus support is located in AP_HAL library and "
"consist of two classes:"
msgstr "硬件 CAN 总线支持的基础位于 AP_HAL 库中，由两个类组成："

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus-driver-roadmap.rst:10
#: e9101fbacb3449bcb699805634b0d4e2
msgid ""
"CANHal class that is responsible for representation of one physical "
"interface on board. This class manages opening, setup and operation of the "
"interface and is a main connection point between software and hardware"
msgstr "CANHal 类，负责表示飞控板上的一个物理接口。该类管理接口的打开、配置和操作，是软件与硬件之间的主要连接点"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus-driver-roadmap.rst:14
#: aecccbecec1443ea8642a9afde382fec
msgid ""
"CANManager class is wrapping all physical interfaces. It does enumeration of"
" interfaces, provides access to them and also holds connection point for "
"accessing UAVCAN managing class."
msgstr "CANManager 类，封装所有物理接口。它负责枚举接口、提供对接口的访问，同时也持有用于访问 UAVCAN 管理类的连接点。"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus-driver-roadmap.rst:19
#: a0bf5f361c674566a4709c9fee8fbadb
msgid "CANHal class"
msgstr "CANHal 类"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus-driver-roadmap.rst:21
#: c83fc06dc3cf44e9bf0c5442b6e4bc45
msgid "New class should be based on AP_HAL::CANHal class."
msgstr "新类应基于 AP_HAL::CANHal 类。"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus-driver-roadmap.rst:23
#: f63e0dbdd5cc43028561091fcb946c15
msgid ""
"The class is responsible for managing the hardware and also managing of RX "
"and TX queues. Apart from this also the time management is provided."
msgstr "该类负责管理硬件以及 RX 和 TX 队列，同时还提供时间管理功能。"

