msgstr "返回自上次调用此方法以来该接口是否至少有一次成功的 IO 操作。设计用于接口活动 LED。"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus-driver-roadmap.rst:88
#: 37801f55f8ef4976a6de8bdb83876d96
msgid ""
"int16_t send(const uavcan::CanFrame& frame, uavcan::MonotonicTime "
"tx_deadline, uavcan::CanIOFlags flags)"
msgstr ""
"int16_t send(const uavcan::CanFrame& frame, uavcan::MonotonicTime "
"tx_deadline, uavcan::CanIOFlags flags)"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus-driver-roadmap.rst:90
#: b4f06a8f72cd4be6bac99caada050ddd
msgid ""
"The method is responsible for putting a new frame to transmitting queue. The"
" maximum transmitting deadline is also provided and it is a responsibility "
"of driver to remove frame from queue if the deadline has passed. The flags "
"can be combination of none or Loopback or AbortOnError."
msgstr ""
"此方法负责将新帧放入发送队列。同时提供最大发送截止时间，驾驶员有责任在截止时间过后从队列中移除帧。flags 可以是 none、Loopback 或 "
"AbortOnError 的组合。"

